# Product data of the Product Data Demo package (ecc-product-data-project),
# merged into one file for the Try it boxes of the SPARQL Basics training module.
# Graphs: prod-vocab, hardware, services, orgmap, bom, supplier
# (all from http://ld.company.org/..., imported by http://ld.company.org/prod-inst/).
#
# Regenerate: export each graph with
#   cmemc graph export http://ld.company.org/<graph>/ --output-file <graph>.ttl
# and merge the files into one Turtle file.
